SUMMARY:First Sunday OMSI $5 Days
DESCRIPTION:Explore the museum’s permanent exhibit halls and labs for just $5 per person on the first Sunday of each month. \n\n\n\n\nTickets for Empirical Theater and Kendall Planetarium shows\, tours of the USS Blueback Submarine as well as select special exhibitions can also be purchased for $5 per person on OMSI $5 Days. \n\n\n\n\nWe anticipate higher traffic on $5 Days and encourage guests to purchase tickets in advance online. Double check OMSI’s website in case this date falls on a holiday!
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/join-us-the-first-sunday-of-each-month-for-omsi-5-days-2-2/2026-05-03/
LOCATION:OMSI
CATEGORIES:Educational,Family Fun,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Museum,STEM
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Screenshot-2024-12-27-at-8.18.36-PM.png
END:VEVENT
