SUMMARY:Portland Cinco de Mayo Fiesta at Tom McCall Waterfront Park
DESCRIPTION:🎉 39TH ANNUAL PORTLAND CINCO DE MAYO FIESTA AT WATERFRONT PARK IN PORTLAND\, OREGON\n📅 Dates: May 1st\, 2nd\, 3rd\, 4th & 5th\, 2026\n📍 Location: Tom McCall Waterfront Park (98 SW Naito Pkwy\, Portland\, OR 97204)\n⏰ Time: 11:00 AM to 11:00 PM (Fri-Sun)\, 4:00 PM to 10:00 PM (Mon-Tues)\n🎟️ TICKETS ON SALE NOW \nThe Portland Guadalajara Sister City Association (PGSCA) invites you to the 39th Annual Portland Cinco de Mayo Fiesta\, a celebration of Mexican culture\, music\, and cuisine at the scenic Tom McCall Waterfront Park. This bilingual festival is Oregon’s largest multicultural event\, open daily with special attractions and performances. \n• 🍲 Savor authentic Mexican flavors with over 40 food vendors.\n• 🔎 Explore the Guadalajara Artisan Village for unique crafts.\n•🎶 Enjoy live music from the acclaimed Mariachi Ciudad de Guadalajara alongside a vibrant lineup of local and international artists!\nHighlights for 2026:\n• Live Music & Performances 🎶\n• Authentic Mexican Food\, Drinks & Sweets 🌮\n• Guadalajara Artisan Village 🏺\n• Naturalization Ceremony 🇺🇸\n• Family Carnival 🎡\n• Sunday Mariachi Mass 🙏\n• Plaza de Niños – Cultural crafts\, games\, activities\, and free face painting 🎨\n• & More \nThis event is over $30. We only include links for higher-priced events from our advertisers — but it’s easy to find with a quick search! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/portland-cinco-de-mayo-fiesta-at-tom-mccall-waterfront-park/2026-05-03/
LOCATION:Tom McCall Waterfront Park\, 98 SW Naito Pkwy\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Festival,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Kids-Activity.jpg
GEO:45.5175968;-122.6725476
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Tom McCall Waterfront Park 98 SW Naito Pkwy Portland OR 97204 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=98 SW Naito Pkwy:geo:-122.6725476,45.5175968
END:VEVENT
